      "mimeType": "text/html",
      "title": "cover.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Share+Tech+Mono&family=Roboto+Mono&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <style>\n    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n    .slide-container { \n      width: 1280px; min-height: 720px; \n      background: #050A0E; color: #E2F1F8;\n      font-family: 'Roboto Mono', monospace;\n      display: flex; flex-direction: column;\n      padding: 40px;\n    }\n    .motif { \n      position: absolute; top: 40px; right: 40px;\n      color: #8AF8FF; font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;\n      font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 2px;\n    }\n    .main-content { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; position: relative; }\n    .wireframe-box {\n      border: 1px solid #1E3A5F;\n      padding: 60px;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n    .wireframe-box::before, .wireframe-box::after {\n      content: ''; position: absolute; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-color: #8AF8FF; border-style: solid;\n    }\n    .wireframe-box::before { top: -1px; left: -1px; border-width: 2px 0 0 2px; }\n    .wireframe-box::after { bottom: -1px; right: -1px; border-width: 0 2px 2px 0; }\n    \n    h1 { font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace; font-size: 64px; color: #8AF8FF; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 4px; margin-bottom: 20px; }\n    .subtitle { font-size: 24px; color: #6B8A9C; letter-spacing: 2px; }\n    \n    .metadata {\n      position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0;\n      font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace; font-size: 14px; color: #6B8A9C;\n      line-height: 1.6;\n    }\n    .cursor { display: inline-block; width: 10px; height: 18px; background: #8AF8FF; animation: blink 1s infinite; vertical-align: middle; margin-left: 5px; }\n    @keyframes blink { 0%, 100% { opacity: 1; } 50% { opacity: 0; } }\n    .page-num { position: absolute; bottom: 40px; right: 40px; font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace; color: #6B8A9C; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"slide-container\">\n    <div class=\"motif\">[ AEGIS v3.2 // SYS.OP.ACTIVE ]</div>\n    <div class=\"main-content\">\n      <div class=\"wireframe-box\">\n        <h1>AEGIS-OS<br>Console Architecture</h1>\n        <div class=\"subtitle\">Technical Summary & System Observability Report</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"metadata\">\n        > NODE_ID: 0x2785_LIVE<br>\n        > SECURITY_LEVEL: UNCLASSIFIED // OSINT<br>\n        > BUILD_VERSION: 6.2.0-STABLE<br>\n        > SESSION_TIMESTAMP: 2026-11-01T14:50:56Z<span class=\"cursor\"></span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"page-num\">[ 01 / 07 ]</div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
